Subject: providers: shared account home, limits deadline, one-shot text generation

ClaudeAdapter re-materialises the shared home (D52); ClaudeProvider gives get_usage its own
deadline; TextGeneration gains the intent and synopsis one-shots (D50, D51); usageLimits reads the
limit class rotation keys on (D63).

